            "review_text": "Xi Ping\nTaipei, Taiwan4 contributions\n2\nVegetarian restaurant Phúc An - a peace of mind in the middle Among the many vegetarian restaurants in Chittagong, Phúc An is the one I want to visit repeatedly. Not only because the cooking is delicious, but because you can feel that heart and warmth once you enter the store. The vegetarian cuisine here is light but does not lose taste, the taste is good, not oily, not made, but let\nJan 2026 • Business\nVegetarian restaurant Phúc An - a peace of mind in the middle\nAmong the many vegetarian restaurants in Chittagong, Phúc An is the one I want to visit repeatedly. Not only because the cooking is delicious, but because you can feel that heart and warmth once you enter the store.\nThe vegetarian cuisine here is light but does not lose the taste, the taste is good, not oily, not made, but people like it once they eat. It is especially recommended to use coconut water cooked dishes, such as coconut and spinach honey, which are naturally sweet, taste comfortable and very vegetarian. The vegetables are fresh, the cooking is fine, and the body and mind feel relaxed after eating.\nThe restaurant space is clean and clean, quiet and comfortable, so that you can feel real tranquility and relaxation, which is very consistent with the spirit of vegan \"confidence and nourishment\". The owner and service staff are kind and honest, and the first-time guests will be carefully introduced to the meal.\nReasonable price, excellent quality, ideal for locals or travelers. If you’re looking for a healthy, delicious and peaceful vegan food in Chaton, Phúc An is definitely worth a try.\n👉 Seriously recommended, will definitely visit again!\nRead more\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten January 8, 2026\nChay Phúc An Vegan\n🍃🌹 Phúc安誠摯感謝您珍貴的五星好評！\n您的滿意與肯定，是引領我們持續用心服務的光芒。\n我們希望為您帶來的不只是美味的蔬食料理，\n更是充滿安心、愛與療癒能量的每一段美好時光。 💖🌿\nRead more\nTranslate response\nWritten January 11, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
