            "review_text": "Đạt\nVung Tau, Vietnam2 contributions\n3\nA relaxing vegetarian experience in Headton Fuan Vegetarian Restaurant is not just a vegetarian place, but a space to slow down and calm down. Once inside, you can feel the simplicity, quiet and warmth that makes it especially precious in a busy city. The dishes here are simple but sophisticated, light but by no means faint. Ingredients fresh, seasoned cha\nDec 2025 • Business\nA relaxing vegetarian experience in Headton\nFuan Vegetarian Restaurant is not just a vegetarian place, but a space to slow down and calm down. Once inside, you can feel the simplicity, quiet and warmth that makes it especially precious in a busy city.\nThe dishes here are simple but sophisticated, light but by no means faint. The ingredients are fresh, the seasoning is just right and the body is relaxed and relaxed after eating. Each dish feels the chef's intention, not to pursue a gorgeous appearance, but to truly focus on quality and health.\nThe drink is refreshing and natural without being overly sweet, making it ideal for balancing and soothing your body after a vegetarian diet. Every detail reflects the store's emphasis on customer experience and health.\nWhat impressed me most was the kindness and sincerity of the owner. The service was unhurried, gentle and natural, making people feel like they were coming home, but also making people want to visit again.\nIf you're looking for a clean, tasty, reasonably priced vegetarian restaurant in Headton that calms your heart, Fuan Vegetarian Restaurant is definitely worth a try. For me, it's a vegetarian restaurant with a \"soul\" and I'll definitely be back.\nRead more\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten January 3, 2026\nChay Phúc An Vegan\n💚🌸 Phúc安純素餐廳誠摯感謝您\nPhúc An 衷心感謝您給予我們滿滿的 5⭐ 愛與支持。\n您的每一則評價，不僅是對我們的肯定，更是溫暖我們心靈的光，鼓勵著 Phúc An 在傳遞純素美食與善意的道路上持續前行。\n我們深信，純素料理不只是為了飽足身體，更是為了滋養內心的平靜、慈悲與正能量。\n因為有您的信任與喜愛，Phúc An 更加用心於每一道料理，細緻呈現每一份風味，守護料理中那份純淨與安然。\n🌿 您的每一次蒞臨，都是我們最大的幸福。\n🌸 您的每一個微笑，都是我們前進的力量。\nPhúc An 純素餐廳 — 用整顆心烹煮愛與溫暖。\n衷心感謝與珍惜。 💚\nRead more\nTranslate response\nWritten January 4, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
