            "review_text": "Han D\n10 contributions\n3\nRecommended for All People like Vegan\nDec 2025 • Family\n⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\nA Simple Vegan Eatery with Heart – A Must-Visit in Vung Tau\nPhuc An Vegan Restaurant is a lovely stop for anyone who enjoys vegan food and a peaceful atmosphere. Located at 04 Le Phung Hieu Street, Ward 8, Vung Tau City, the restaurant has a simple, clean, and calming space that immediately makes you feel relaxed.\nThe food is 100% vegan, light and well-balanced, not oily or heavy. I was especially impressed by the braised young jackfruit with coconut water – it is cooked with fresh coconut water, not coconut milk, giving it a naturally sweet and gentle flavor without being greasy. Other dishes are also well-seasoned and highlight the natural taste of the ingredients.\nThe drinks are another big plus, including:\nSix-herb herbal drink with grass jelly and chia seeds\nLemongrass lime drink with chia seeds\nRoselle kumquat tea\nAll are refreshing and perfect to pair with vegan meals.\nThe restaurant is open from 6:00 AM to 1:00 PM, making it ideal for breakfast or a light lunch. The owners and staff are extremely kind and welcoming, serving guests with genuine care and warmth.\nIf you are looking for a place in Vung Tau that offers healthy vegan food, reasonable prices, and a peaceful atmosphere, Phuc An Vegan Restaurant is definitely worth a visit. I will surely come back again.\n👉 Highly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten December 28, 2025\nChay Phúc An Vegan\n🌷🙏 Phúc An respectfully bows in gratitude for your loving 5⭐.\nEvery compliment and every look of satisfaction from you is our most precious reward, giving us the confidence to continue sowing seeds of kindness through each pure and wholesome vegan dish. 🍀💫\nRead more\nWritten December 29, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
