            "review_text": "Traveler02682362214\n8 contributions\n3\nRestaurants to visit in Vung Tau\nAug 2025 • Family\nA vegan restaurant I met in Vung Tau that heals the mind and body\nPhúc An Vegan is one of the most haunting vegan restaurants in Vung Tau. From the moment you step inside, you will be surrounded by a quiet, warm and gentle atmosphere. Every detail of the food presentation and the space is meticulous and beautiful.\nThe food served here is more than just vegan. Each one is made with the heart, the balance of flavors is wonderful, and the taste is gentle on the body and mind. Whether you're vegan or looking for a healthy, high-quality meal, this is a place to be.\nAnd most impressive of all, the warm hospitality of the staff. They are always calm and kind, giving you a sense of security as if you were home.\nIf you're visiting Vung Tau, Phúc An Vegan is a must-visit, offering delicious vegan food and healing time at the same time.\nIt's a restaurant I can wholeheartedly recommend and befitting a five-star restaurant.\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten December 28, 2025\nChay Phúc An Vegan\n💮🌱\n心より、Phúc Anはお客様の温かいご愛顧と大切な5つ星の評価に深く感謝申し上げます。\nお客様が召し上がる一つ一つのヴィーガン料理が、私たちにとって愛と安らぎの種をまく尊いご縁です。🌷🌿\nRead more\nTranslate response\nWritten December 29, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
